\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The VOUCH pipeline. Phase 0 plants paired ghost canaries and commits to the manifest \DIFaddbeginFL  {\color {blue}\uwave {as a Merkle tree}}\DIFaddendFL  ; Phase 1 unlearns with the in-twins riding along; Phase 2 \DIFaddbeginFL  {\color {blue}\uwave {opens one leaf at a time in a committed random order and }}\DIFaddendFL  streams the pairs through three coupled anytime-valid processes---the per-score certificate minimum, the betting confidence sequence, and the revocation mixture---whose boundary crossings trigger issuance, continued monitoring, or revocation. R-VOUCH probes rerun the loop on relearned, quantised, and jailbroken variants before a robust certificate is issued.}}{16}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:flowchart}{{1}{16}{The VOUCH pipeline. Phase 0 plants paired ghost canaries and commits to the manifest \DIFaddbeginFL \DIFaddFL {as a Merkle tree}\DIFaddendFL ; Phase 1 unlearns with the in-twins riding along; Phase 2 \DIFaddbeginFL \DIFaddFL {opens one leaf at a time in a committed random order and }\DIFaddendFL streams the pairs through three coupled anytime-valid processes---the per-score certificate minimum, the betting confidence sequence, and the revocation mixture---whose boundary crossings trigger issuance, continued monitoring, or revocation. R-VOUCH probes rerun the loop on relearned, quantised, and jailbroken variants before a robust certificate is issued}{figure.1}{}}
